&lt;p&gt;「&lt;code&gt;MaybeUninit&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;::zeroed()&lt;/code&gt; 是 &lt;code&gt;MaybeUninit&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;::uninit()&lt;/code&gt; 的另一种构造函数。它指示编译器用零填充 &lt;code&gt;T&lt;/code&gt; 的位。」&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>7.1.3 ptr::write 与赋值</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Rust/comprehensiveRust/unsafe/initialization/maybeuninit/03-write-vs-assignment/</link><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 11:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Rust/comprehensiveRust/unsafe/initialization/maybeuninit/03-write-vs-assignment/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
